  "bodyHash": "1fb098feb523b20c",
  "content": "\n\n<p>你是否一直夢想擁有一個畫面更銳利、色彩更生動、質感更精緻的《我的世界》，同時又不失其體素藝術的靈魂？不用再找了。Tazko's Fresh Textures 就是這款頂級材質包，將乾淨清爽的美學風格帶入你的世界，讓它煥然一新。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_acd9a106-44d6-47e1-bac1-e38c132c6080.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"815\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>木製工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_0ef0fe74-bd8e-418c-8716-6c25aac8c8dc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>石製工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_128d85b1-0ec0-4da2-8c9b-0c2ba2acc452.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>鐵製工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_6d9e92c8-84f1-4c26-a965-1ddfd5357877.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>銅製工具（僅限 1.21.9 及以上版本）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;- 工具會隨耐久度消耗而逐漸氧化</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_82bf4519-709a-4a97-8d3e-f728df79e9ad.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>金製工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_9c5c358a-fd04-4511-bd83-7326ed6c3cb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>鑽石工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_57729a47-e0b1-434d-a45d-542b2eecc009.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>下界合金工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_f718bee7-ded2-4e4f-bffa-85e9f3c7d57e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_00cd6545-5936-4d03-9809-ace0ab98a985.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n<p>- 搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respackopts</a> 模組可進行重要設定變更：可在「一般模式」與「PVP 模式」（如劍刃縮短等）之間切換，或更換字型（新增 4 種）。</p>",
